<title>FRANCE: Sanofi stronger on Irbesartan registering.</title>
<headline>Sanofi stronger on Irbesartan registering.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanofi shares rose sharply on Tuesday after news of the registering of Irbesartan hypertension drug by Sanofi parent Elf Aquitaine.</p>
<p>Sanofi shares were up 10.8 francs or 2.55 percent at 434 at 1202 GMT against the trend on the CAC 40 leading share index.</p>
</text>
